      "parameters": {
        "content": "Hi {{ $json.name.split(' ')[0] }},\n\n🎉 **Your appointment is confirmed!**\n\n📅 **When:** {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.appointment_time).toFormat('EEEE, MMMM d') }} at {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.appointment_time).toFormat('h:mm a') }}\n🕐 **Duration:** 30 minutes\n💻 **Meeting Link:** {{ $json.meeting_link }}\n\n**What to expect:**\n✓ Review your current coverage situation\n✓ Discuss your protection goals\n✓ Get personalized recommendations\n✓ Answer all your questions\n\n**Before our call, please:**\n• Have details of any current policies handy\n• Think about your coverage goals\n• Prepare any questions you have\n\nI'm looking forward to helping you find the perfect coverage!\n\nIf you need to reschedule, just reply to this email or text me at {{ $env.AGENT_PHONE }}.\n\nBest regards,\n{{ $env.AGENT_NAME }}\n{{ $env.AGENCY_NAME }}\n{{ $env.AGENT_PHONE }}",
